{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06097","headline":"沈十四拾遗新竹生读经处同诸公之作 · 王维","name":"沈十四拾遗新竹生读经处同诸公之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居日清静，修竹自檀栾。\n嫩节留余箨，新丛出旧阑。\n细枝风响乱，疎影月光寒。\n乐府裁龙笛，渔家伐钓竿。\n何如道门里，青翠拂仙坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}